eason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123741","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123741.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123741.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Partially implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13324\r\n\r\nThis PR slightly improves the workflow and readability by showing the custom type you are creating within the list of items, it's placed at the very bottom, so it'll only really show up once you start typing in something exotic. \r\nAfter creating your custom type, you will immediately be presented with a selector to select it's base type, getting rid of the rather awkward step where you go to the tab that does nothing except let you select a base type. \r\n\r\nIf the user would rather not select a base type immediately, they can either cancel or press enter which they'll skip the prompt. However, in (I imagine) 99% of the time, you will always be immediately setting the base type. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/927d1af3-8190-40d7-9872-3a64669296e8\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123741/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123741/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}